{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-03-15 10:38:00', 'title': 'PENELEC CONDUCTS ANNUAL STORM RESTORATION DRILL TO HELP EMPLOYEES PREPARE FOR REAL-LIFE EVENTS', 'text': 'ERIE, PA., MARCH 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PENELEC, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), RECENTLY COMPLETED ITS YEARLY EMERGENCY PREPARATION DRILL FOCUSED ON TESTING ITS STORM RESTORATION PROCESS IN THE EVENT SEVERE WEATHER CAUSES WIDESPREAD OUTAGES THROUGHOUT ITS VAST AND LARGELY RURAL SERVICE AREA. PENELEC CONDUCTED THE DRILL VIRTUALLY TO ALIGN WITH ITS PANDEMIC PROTOCOL, WHICH INCLUDES NOT GATHERING FOR LARGE IN-PERSON MEETINGS TO SAFEGUARD EMPLOYEES FROM THE CORONAVIRUS.'}